 u star the bromow fields doc pls\", \"no wait wrong one, i meant the keanery one\", \"oh and do i have any pics of Bianca Namova\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0015\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to work out how much I actually wrote down on our holidays, so how many notes are in the Glenfinnan trips notebook?\", \"Different thing, the wifi's playing up and I need to log into the box, so can you show me the router password, the actual password itself?\", \"Oh, and I think I got rid of the wrap task by accident earlier, could you bring it back out of the bin for me?\"], [\"umm how many notes have I got in the, uh, Glenfinnan trips notebook?\", \"ok and can you show me the router password, like... the actual password?\", \"oh and um, the wrap task, can you get that back out of the bin?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0016\", \"v\": [[\"um can you pull up the Soly streaming entry in my locker? just the entry, not the, uh, not the password\"], [\"Could you please show me the Soly streaming entry in my locker? I don't need the password itself, just the entry.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0017\", \"v\": [[\"I'm at a friend's place and their TV wants me to sign in, so what's the actual Soly streaming password?\"], [\"umm for Soly streaming, what's the... what's the actual password again?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0018\", \"v\": [[\"whats gone into lacemaking share\", \"diff thing, when's Almudena's bday\", \"oh and whats left to do for the raft\"], [\"Could you show me what's gone into lacemaking share, please?\", \"Also, could you tell me when Almudena's birthday is?\", \"One more thing, could you tell me what's still left to do about the raft?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0019\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you delete, like, every keanery event I've got?\", \"oh wait no, scratch that, put them back\", \"ok um, different thing, have I got any photos taken at Oilskin?\", \"and uh... which to-dos are overdue? like past their due date and not done\", \"oh, the sharpen one's done actually\"], [\"I'm finished with the whole keanery thing now, so could you just delete every keanery event on my calendar?\", \"Hmm, actually I've changed my mind, I might still need those. Scratch that and put them back, please.\", \"Different thing, I was telling someone about a night out, so do I have any photos taken at Oilskin?\", \"I've been a bit slack lately and want to catch up, so which to-dos are past their due date and still not done?\", \"Oh, I actually got round to the sharpen one already, so you can mark that as done.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0020\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me whether anything is happening on thursday, please?\", \"And what about monday?\"], [\"anything on thursday\", \"and monday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0021\", \"v\": [[\"Could you show me which photos I have from Ravello Deli, please?\", \"Also, could you tell me what Jelena Wakefield's balance with me is in the sitar kitty group?\", \"And what about Drinine?\"], [\"I'm putting together a little album of our nights out, so what pics have I got from Ravello Deli?\", \"Different thing, I'd like to square up before anyone has to ask, so what's Jelena Wakefield's balance with me in the sitar kitty group?\", \"And while we're on it, what about Drinine?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0022\", \"v\": [[\"We haven't been out in ages and I fancy a treat, so could you reserve a table at Premow Island for tonight?\", \"Fair enough. Totally different thing, I'm trying to remember what we got up to a while back, so can you show me the shots from September?\", \"One more thing, I've completely lost track of who owes who, so where do I stand with Thavmoara Venkatesan in Premow trip?\"], [\"can u book a table at Premow Island for tonight\", \"ok show me the shots from September\", \"where do i stand w Thavmoara Venkatesan in Premow trip\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0023\", \"v\": [[\"star my cabinet document\", \"text Runnou, running late\", \"what's in my Kids notebook\"], [\"I keep losing it whenever I need it, so could you star my cabinet document?\", \"I'm stuck in traffic and it's not looking good, can you text Runnou that I'm running late?\", \"Okay, different thing, I've been jotting stuff down about the little ones for ages, so what have I written in the Kids notebook?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0025\", \"v\": [[\"I was tidying up my to-do list and might have been a bit trigger-happy, so did I bin the wrap task?\"], [\"did i bin the wrap task??\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0026\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you trash the deli photo?\", \"oh no wait, I didn't mean that, can you bring it back?\"], [\"bin the deli photo\", \"undo, bring it back\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0028\", \"v\": [[\"what did i write yesterday in my diary\", \"diff thing, anything to do w Bromow?\", \"the fifth one, show me pics from there\", \"hang on, whos gonna be at the estate agent\", \"ok back to the bromow stuff, the second one, where was it taken\"], [\"I was feeling a bit off and want to look back on it, so what did I write yesterday in my diary?\", \"Different thing, I'm trying to pull together everything from that area, so can you find anything to do with Bromow?\", \"The fifth one looks like what I'm after, could you show me the photos from there?\", \"Oh, hang on, before I forget, I need to prep for it, so who'll be at the estate agent?\", \"Right, going back to the Bromow stuff we were looking at, where was the second one taken?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0030\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to keep my spending in check, so in sitar kitty, how much have I actually spent?\", \"Different thing, someone was asking about a night out, so what photos do I have from The Old Oilskin?\", \"And is there anything in my expenses about it too? I feel like I paid for something there.\"], [\"sitar kitty, how much spent?\", \"pics from The Old Oilskin\", \"anything in expenses too?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0031\", \"v\": [[\"I want to see where all the money's been going, so what have I spent on in sitar kitty?\"], [\"umm what've I been spending on in, uh, sitar kitty?\"]]}","ttft_ms":31028,"type":"